How to run: Type this in Terminal of cd of the file
Fortran file:
For the Assignment.f90 file Run Guide
step 1: gfortran "FileToRun.f90" -o "ExecutableFileName" 
Step 2: Press Enter
step 3: .\ "ExecutableFileName.exe"
Example
C:\Users\danis\Documents\fortran90> gfortran Assignment.f90 -o number
PS C:\Users\danis\Documents\fortran90> .\number.exe

C file
For the Assignment.c file Run Guide
step 1: gcc "FileToRun.c" -o "ExecutableFileName" 
Step 2: Press Enter
step 3: .\ "ExecutableFileName.exe"
Example
PS C:\Users\danis\Documents\fortran90> gcc Assignment.c  -o numbers
PS C:\Users\danis\Documents\fortran90> ./numbers.exe